          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Boka’s kids oral care collection features pediatric‑friendly toothpaste for kids and fun, effective toothbrush options to make brushing more enjoyable for little smiles. Whether you’re reaching for a fluoride‑free toothpaste in tasty fruit flavors like watermelon, orange cream, or strawberry mango to assist healthy habits, this lineup helps support everyday oral care routines with a gentle touch. Choose from a variety of fun‑flavored tubes and kid‑approved designs that help make twice‑daily brushing feel like a treat.</p>"
