    "e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_tJyKKh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the Boka x America’s ToothFairy partnership?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We’re partnering with America’s ToothFairy to help kids achieve healthier smiles. For every <em>new</em> subscription to a Boka Kids toothpaste, we’ll donate a Kids Oral Health Kit to a public library serving families in need.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7W7Lpc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s included in the kit?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Each kit comes with 1x travel-size Boka Kids Toothpaste, 1x Boka Classic Toothbrush, 1 Boka Strawberry Mango Floss, and an activity booklet filled with fun tips for good oral care habits.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8VHBzL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I donate a kit?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It’s easy—just start a <em>new subscription</em> to any Boka Kids toothpaste on boka.com. Every new subscription = one donated kit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jexD7x": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I already have a subscription. Does that count?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We’re so glad you’re part of the Boka fam! But to donate a kit, you’ll need to start a <em>new</em> subscription to a Kids toothpaste flavor. Existing subscriptions don’t count toward this initiative.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JABJVy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I want to donate more than one kit?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>To donate more than one kit, just subscribe to multiple Kids toothpastes in separate new subscriptions. For example, if you subscribe to two different flavors (like Blueberry Dragon Fruit and Orange Cream), that’s two kits donated. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yPB79G": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this apply to all Boka products?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>This donation program is only for <em>new subscriptions</em> to our Boka Kids toothpastes—including our newest flavor, Blueberry Dragon Fruit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_d9AH6m": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will this run?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>While supplies last.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ajqd7y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who is America’s ToothFairy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>They’re a nonprofit focused on helping kids across the U.S. get access to essential dental care and education. We’re proud to support their mission to prevent tooth decay before it starts. Learn more about them <a href=\"https://www.americastoothfairy.org/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15180629016619__e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28-collapsible_row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is nano-hydroxyapatite toothpaste safe for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Boka’s nano-hydroxyapatite toothpaste for kids is specifically formulated to be safe for children, even if swallowed when using the recommended amount. It is a fluoride‑free toothpaste that supports everyday oral care with gentle cleaning.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15180629016619__e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28-collapsible_row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using Boka’s n-Ha toothpaste for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Using nano-hydroxyapatite (n-Ha) toothpaste, like Boka's, offers several benefits for kids:</p><ul><li><strong>Nano-hydroxyapatite</strong>: An ingredient researched for use in oral care products</li><li><strong>Surface Stain Remova</strong>l: Formulated to help remove surface stains with regular brushing</li><li><strong>Freshens Breath</strong>: Leaves breath feeling fresh<br/><br/></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CpFBrM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I remineralize my child's teeth?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>One approach is daily brushing with a toothpaste for kids that contains nano-hydroxyapatite and fun flavors like blueberry dragon fruit, orange cream, strawberry mango, or watermelon mint. Regular dental visits to a dentist are important to create the right care plan for your child. Nano-hydroxyapatite is studied for its use in oral care products, and your dentist can discuss options based on your child’s specific needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15180629016619__e1c2be8a-c503-489a-b63e-982e50c35a28-collapsible_row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the flavors of Boka toothpaste available for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka Kids' Toothpaste comes in four flavors:<a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/orange-cream-n-ha-toothpaste\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.boka.com/products/blueberry-dragonfruit-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blueberry Dragon Fruit</span></a>, <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/products/strawberry-mango-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Strawberry Mango</span></a>,<a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/orange-cream-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Orange Cream</span></a>, and<a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/watermelon-mint-n-ha-toothpaste\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon Mint</span></a>, with natural ingredients that make brushing enjoyable and leave breath feeling fresh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "16ab04bf-3b77-4c35-b24e-778a14934e1f": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Boka Kids' Toothpaste safe for kids?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Boka Kids' Toothpaste is safe for children and free of harsh ingredients like sodium lauryl sulfate. It is formulated to be gentle for daily use and is free from artificial dyes and artificial flavors. It is free of harsh chemicals and is safe for kids to swallow when using the recommended amount. The toothpaste is also vegan, cruelty-free, and gluten-free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ewp6wj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which kids’ toothpaste options contain nano-hydroxyapatite?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>All of Boka’s toothpaste for kids includes nano-hydroxyapatite. Check out the two flavors:<a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/orange-cream-n-ha-toothpaste\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Orange Cream</span></a> and<a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids/products/watermelon-mint-n-ha-toothpaste\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon Mint.</span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> </span>You may also explore options like the <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/products/blueberry-dragonfruit-n-ha-toothpaste\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blueberry Dragon Fruit n‑Ha Toothpaste</span></a>, the <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/products/kids-variety-pack\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Variety Pack</span></a>, and other fruity tubes listed above.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "fcdc03f5-1552-493d-9d04-47760da9f0df": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can my child use Boka Kids' Toothpaste if they have sensitive teeth?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, our fluoride-free toothpaste is designed to be gentle for kids with sensitive gums or preferences for milder flavors and textures. It contains nano-hydroxyapatite, an ingredient researched for use in oral care products.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4BDnWc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why do some dentists choose hydroxyapatite toothpaste for children?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Some dentists recommend hydroxyapatite toothpaste as a fluoride‑free toothpaste alternative that fits into everyday brushing habits. Nano-hydroxyapatite is studied for use in oral care products. Boka’s toothpaste for kids provides gentle cleaning with fun flavors like strawberry mango, fruit punch‑like watermelon, and more, making brushing enjoyable.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WEJrgC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can flavored toothpaste for kids make brushing easier at home?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Fun kid toothpaste flavors can help children build consistent twice‑daily brushing habits. Many families find that pleasant flavors and engaging tubes make oral care feel more like a routine they enjoy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
